# Dashboard conventions

- React + TypeScript (strict) + Vite, managed with pnpm (`mise exec -- pnpm ...` inside `web/`).
- First line of every source file: `// SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-PolyForm-Shield-1.0.0`.
- UI components from Mantine; icons from `@tabler/icons-react`. No other UI kits.
- Server state through TanStack Query hooks in `web/src/api`; types for API payloads live next to
  the hooks and mirror `api/openapi.yaml`.
- Routes in `web/src/routes`; one page component per route, shared parts in `web/src/components`.
- Destructive or irreversible actions always go through a confirmation modal; irreversible ones
  require typing the cluster name.
- Show only actions allowed by the cluster's `capabilities`.
- UI text in English; mention "Apache Kafka" only descriptively and keep the ASF attribution in the
  footer.
